OL,3,GNEWSAFurther arrest as part of murder
OL,4,Ainvestigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fassisting an offender following the
OL,8,Fdeath of a man whose body was found
OL,9,Flast month.
OL,11,FThe body of Christopher Streather, 51,
OL,12,Fwas discovered at an address on High
OL,13,FStreet in Burton Latimer,
OL,14,FNorthamptonshire, on 2 September.
OL,16,FNorthamptonshire Police said the man,
OL,17,Faged in his 70s and from Burton
OL,18,FLatimer, remained in custody.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
